## Rust
# Build output for any Cargo project in rust_core/.
target/

# rustc/rustfmt temporary files.
**/*.rs.bk

# Keep Cargo.lock files committed for reproducible application builds.

## Format test
# Scratch output from unzipping the .DAWproject files in
# .docs/DAWproject-format-test/. The archives themselves stay tracked.
.docs/DAWproject-format-test/extracted/

## Environment and local configuration
# Keep example files such as .env.example tracked; ignore local secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

## Editors and operating systems
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.iml

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
